{"id":"vod_sn_35792","vodId":"35792","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"终结的炽天使","name_cn":"终结的炽天使","date":"2015-01-01","year":"2015","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/3eb8e32b996dd0609c818da420c2e433.jpg"},"summary":"故事发生在遥远的未来，一种神秘的病毒侵袭了地球，十三岁以上的人类全部灭绝，可是，对于那些幸存下来的孩子们来说，活着却并不意味着幸运，横空出世的吸血鬼一族成为了地球上的统治者，而这些孩子们则作为它们的口粮被“饲养”起来。　　优一郎（入野自由 配音）和米伽尔（小野贤章 配音）不愿意向命运低头，为了反抗，优一郎加入了日本帝鬼军，成为了月鬼组的一员。在那里，优一郎结识了特立独行的柊筱娅（早见沙织 配音）、善良软弱的早乙女与一（冈本信彦 配音）、温文尔雅的君月士方（石川界人 配音）和大大咧咧的三宫三叶（井口裕香 配音），五人成为了生死与共的战友。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:37:42","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/5RbkM40rPb1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/BPYvarSKnX1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/HWyvVACuWd1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/yhmVhZUA3v1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/ic8WahAudx1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/he2cmLcCV41/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/khbVDNGfbh1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/dyzZcKwTKL1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/98zAfQ2yvE1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/v6T7HxBvTs1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/bg76CLLEdC1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/jnZXgqptD71/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:45:30.721Z"}